Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 16, 2020; provided, the amended provisions of subparagraphs 6 through 8 of Article 11 and subparagraph 2 (a) 8) through 14) of attached Table 2 shall enter into force on July 16, 2020.
Article 2 (Applicability to Reporting on Corrective Orders)
The amended provisions of Article 10 (2) and (3) shall begin to apply to cases where a corrective order is issued pursuant to Article 31 (1) of the Act after this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 Omitted.

